hplip-arm64 builds the hpcups filter and uses a PPD from HPLIP 3.26.6
(HP Linux Imaging and Printing), https://developers.hp.com/hp-linux-imaging-and-printing
Source: https://sourceforge.net/projects/hplip/files/hplip/3.26.6/

HPLIP is Copyright (c) 2001-2015 HP Development Company, L.P. and is
distributed under the GNU General Public License version 2 (see LICENSE);
some hpcups source files additionally carry HP's BSD-style notice, which is
retained in the HPLIP sources that build.sh downloads.

The patches in patches/, the build and packaging scripts, and the helper
scripts in this repository are released under GPL-2.0-or-later.

Binary releases are built by build.sh from the unmodified HPLIP 3.26.6
tarball (SHA-256 5fb2235a9cb6ec07cb4786c4066b151359c301324d54aaabf69ae7eef35606b3)
plus the patches in patches/.
